{"obsah":"<p>Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Martin Šimůnek enjoyed two shows at Ladronka and one longer exhibition at the local Cycling Day in Březno on a beautiful, almost summery Sunday.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>At Ladronka the guys were joined by a group of parkour athletes, and together they put on a decent show for a chanting crowd.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The Cycling Day was at a more relaxed pace, with Vlasta's offspring getting involved and firing up the local kids, who tried out the smallest obstacles after the exhibition. In the end even the parents ended up on bikes :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FIMG_2068.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FIMG_2068.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237637\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FIMG_2115.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FIMG_2115.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237642\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FIMG_2114.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FIMG_2114.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237638\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-c